### Cadastrar um animal
POST http://localhost:3333/animals
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "tag": "BR-001",
  "sex": "MALE",
  "category": "CALF",
  "breed": "Nelore",
  "birthPrecision": "MONTH_YEAR",
  "birthDate": "2024-03-01",
  "notes": "Primeiro animal cadastrado"
}

